		(uuid "5b681a60-2719-4474-b3bc-bec2dc7390fe")
	)
	(text "U2 is the fixed-5 V version: FB senses +5V, no divider.\n~SHDN tied to +12V: always on. D5 = catch diode.\nC7 = bootstrap cap (CB to SW)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 265.43 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "71358c78-b18a-4ff3-8330-c8f4c9bcb6e1")
	)
	(text "EN tied to VIN: on whenever +5V is up. Pin 4 is NC.\nPd = (5.0 V - 3.3 V) x I(+3V3) (calc)."
